decisions:
  - id: observation-complete-adaptation-missing
    decision: The observation layer is complete; the adaptation layer is the missing piece
    rationale: Six systems collect data but none feed back into CLAUDE.md or agent behavior. The graduation pipeline proves the closed-loop pattern works — it just hasn't been applied to the instruction layer yet.
  - id: claude-md-generation-is-leverage
    decision: Programmatic CLAUDE.md generation is the key leverage point
    rationale: claude.ts already generates CLAUDE.md from config. Injecting data-driven sections (tool usage, calibration insights, relevant notebooks) requires no change to user workflow — just richer inputs to the existing generator.
tags:
  - arc:agent-learning-loop
